{
  "description": "Conservative inventory of distinct strategy configurations that were backtested during the research phase of ai_signal_cc2_harness. Used by run_selection_bias.py --auto to pass a realistic N_trials into the Deflated Sharpe Ratio / Haircut calculation. Update this file whenever you run a new comparison / grid / experiment.",
  "references": "Bailey & Lopez de Prado (2014) The Deflated Sharpe Ratio. N should count every distinct strategy configuration whose backtest was inspected, not just the single final choice.",
  "scripts": [
    {
      "script": "grid_search.py",
      "phase": "coarse",
      "param_space": "risk_aversion(7) * turnover_penalty(5) * max_te_annual(1) * max_single_turnover(2) * sector_deviation(2)",
      "trials": 140
    },
    {
      "script": "grid_search.py",
      "phase": "fine",
      "param_space": "ra(5) * tp(5) * mst(3) * sd(3) centered on Phase 1 best (minus ~5 overlaps with coarse)",
      "trials": 220
    },
    {
      "script": "compare_improvements.py",
      "phase": "pca x sector_interactions",
      "param_space": "{A_Baseline, B_PartialPCA, C_SectorIX, D_Combined}",
      "trials": 4
    },
    {
      "script": "compare_pca.py",
      "phase": "pca_n_remove sweep",
      "param_space": "{5, 3, 2}",
      "trials": 3
    },
    {
      "script": "compare_max_weight.py",
      "phase": "max_weight sweep",
      "param_space": "[0.20, 0.25, 0.30, 0.35]",
      "trials": 4
    },
    {
      "script": "experiment_te_sensitivity.py",
      "phase": "TE sensitivity",
      "param_space": "te_values=[0.125, 0.15, 0.175, 0.20] iterated across multiple sub-experiments",
      "trials": 8
    },
    {
      "script": "experiment_monthly_rebal.py",
      "phase": "monthly vs 10d rebalance",
      "param_space": "{monthly, current}",
      "trials": 2
    },
    {
      "script": "manual_config_tuning",
      "phase": "LightGBM hyperparameter tuning (lr, leaves, depth, child_samples, subsample, colsample, alpha, lambda, n_est)",
      "param_space": "estimated from git log / memory - conservative lower bound",
      "trials": 15
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_ACDE",
      "phase": "structural redesign: cap-weighted BM (A), lean feature set 239 (C), LightGBM stabilisation (D), optimiser re-tuning (E)",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_11_growth_balance",
      "phase": "C+ follow-up: restore multi-horizon EPS/Sales/FCF growth + add 17 growth composite features (new 'Growth' group) to balance Quality vs Growth style representation",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "FAILED: IR 0.62 -> 0.23, rolled back to A+C+D+E"
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_11_PM_core_satellite",
      "phase": "F: reduce to 81 hand-picked core features + enable core-satellite portfolio style (max_active_share 0.40 L1, max_active_per_stock 0.06)",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_11_PM_score_gated_ow",
      "phase": "G: block OW on stocks with z-score < 0 (prevent MVO diversification quirk from overweighting negative signals)",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_12_core_v2",
      "phase": "H: further pruned core features 81 -> 46 based on feature_importance ranking from previous run",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "redesign_2026_04_12_financials_universe",
      "phase": "I: restore JPM/GS by switching from all-sheet intersection to essential-sheet intersection. Optional sheets (FCF/CAPEX/EV_EBITDA) have NaN for banks, filled by per-date median. Universe 48 -> 50.",
      "param_space": "single coordinated change set, not a grid",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "rl_hybrid_v1",
      "phase": "ai_signal_cc2_rl Meta-Controller(4) + Signal Overlay(7 feature groups) PPO. Pretrain cutoff 2024-12-31, walk-forward fine-tune every ~63d (2 episodes). Base config = iter15_65tkr_reb21_vtg.",
      "param_space": "single coordinated RL configuration (rl_enabled=true, rl_mode=hybrid, rl_overlay_clip=0.30)",
      "trials": 1
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S7_A1_mu_vol_scaling",
      "phase": "S7 AI-logic arm (2026-07-06): Grinold variance-scaling mu_i = z_i * sigma_i / median_CS(sigma). Single pre-registered parameter-free transform, no sweep.",
      "param_space": "mu_vol_scaling_enabled=true (single pre-registered form)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.552503 (dIR +0.0711 < +0.36 SE, subperiod sign inconsistent: P1/P2 down, P3 up) -> gate not met, OFF-default, no flip"
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S7_A2_confidence_spread_recal",
      "phase": "S7 AI-logic arm (2026-07-06): confidence spread_scale recalibrated from default 0.20 to D0 raw_spread median. Single pre-registered value, no sweep.",
      "param_space": "confidence_spread_scale=3.57587 (single pre-registered value)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.483625 (dIR +0.0022, subperiod P2 sign inconsistent -0.112) -> gate not met, OFF-default, no flip"
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S7_A3_adaptive_ema",
      "phase": "S7 AI-logic arm (2026-07-06): trailing-IC adaptive prediction EMA, alpha_t=clip(0.5+(tIC-m)/(2*IQR),0.25,0.75) with m/IQR anchored to D0 trailing_ic_dist. Single pre-registered functional form, no sweep. 2-pass injection, src/ untouched.",
      "param_space": "adaptive-EMA single pre-registered functional form (D0-anchored constants, zero free params)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.484346 (dIR +0.0029, subperiod P2 -0.432 sign inconsistent) -> gate not met, OFF-default, no flip"
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S7_A4_seed_ensemble",
      "phase": "S7 AI-logic arm (2026-07-06): LGBM seed ensemble k=5, seeds {42,43,44,45,46}, finite-mean of pre-EMA z-panels + per-date CS restandardize + EMA(0.5). Single pre-registered config, no k sweep. 2-pass injection, src/ untouched.",
      "param_space": "seed ensemble k=5 (single pre-registered config, no k sweep)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.317520 (dIR -0.1639) -> gate not met, OFF-default, no flip. NOTE: seed 43-46 full harvests = per-seed diagnostics 4 runs (non-selection input to A4, NOT counted as trials); per-seed IR 42=1.481/43=1.184/44=1.057/45=1.110/46=1.406 quantifies seed-luck variance."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S8_news_trend_feature",
      "phase": "S8 sentiment feature arm (2026-07-07): single pre-registered feature `news_trend` (NEWS_SENTIMENT_DAILY_AVG 5d-21d rolling-mean spread) conditionally added to the core whitelist via the news_trend_feature_enabled flag. default-OFF, no sweep. Feature-panel change forces a full pipeline re-run (not cache-safe); ECOS solver, src feature code untouched.",
      "param_space": "news_trend_feature_enabled=true (single pre-registered feature)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.272249 (dIR -0.2092, subperiod P1/P2/P3 dIR all negative -0.053/-0.309/-0.180) -> gate not met, OFF-default, no flip. Feature injection confirmed (model features 61->62, exactly +news_trend). TE 0.030094 (<=0.045, character preserved), ECOS 188 / fallback 0.0%."
    },
    {
      "script": "iter15_65tkr_reb21_vtg_causal_recert",
      "phase": "Causal-discipline S0' re-certification (2026-07-10, user-directed): production variant iter15 with causal_validation_enabled=true + execution_signal_lag_days=1 (both correctness fixes flipped simultaneously). New reference baseline under causal discipline. Distinct config (IR changed, NOT a byte-identical OFF-parity recheck like exp_s0_recheck_d2), counted per redesign-precedent (adopted structural baseline change = 1 trial). ECOS, --no-cache.",
      "param_space": "causal_validation_enabled=true + execution_signal_lag_days=1 on iter15_65tkr_reb21_vtg (coordinated correctness flip, no sweep)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 0.902 (vs pre-causal 1.481, -0.579; active 2.59%, TE 2.87%, turnover 106.8%, realized_beta 0.993, MDD -29.5%; P1 0.14/P2 0.22/P3 2.09). pre-causal 1.481 retired as comparison base (val-label leakage + t-close-fill optimism). Becomes the S0' reference all challengers are measured against."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_causal_val_only",
      "phase": "Causal contribution decomposition arm A (2026-07-10): causal_validation_enabled=true only (exec_lag=0) on iter15 base, isolating the val-label leakage (early-stopping) fix. Single-flag diagnostic arm, ECOS, --no-cache.",
      "param_space": "causal_validation_enabled=true, execution_signal_lag_days=0 (single decomposition arm)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 0.920 (dIR -0.561 vs pre-causal 1.481; P1 0.26/P2 0.30/P3 2.05). Attributes ~all of the S0 IR drop to val-label leakage repair; P1 collapse 1.59->0.26. Diagnostic decomposition, not a production candidate."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_exec_lag_only",
      "phase": "Causal contribution decomposition arm B (2026-07-10): execution_signal_lag_days=1 only (causal_val off) on iter15 base, isolating the t-close-signal/t-close-fill optimism fix. Single-flag diagnostic arm, ECOS, --no-cache.",
      "param_space": "causal_validation_enabled=false, execution_signal_lag_days=1 (single decomposition arm)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.486 (dIR +0.005 vs pre-causal 1.481; P1 1.38/P2 0.64/P3 2.10). 1d execution lag alone is noise-band (|dIR|<1SE). Diagnostic decomposition, not a production candidate."
    },
    {
      "script": "codex_causal_rank_65",
      "phase": "GPT-5.6 challenger (2026-07-10): rank_xendcg LightGBM objective (model_objective=cross_sectional_rank, metric=ndcg) + causal validation split + 1d execution signal lag. Reuses default-OFF causal infra. Single pre-registered config, no sweep. ECOS, --no-cache full re-run.",
      "param_space": "lgbm objective=rank_xendcg + causal_validation_enabled=true + execution_signal_lag_days=1 (single pre-registered challenger config)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "IR 1.695 vs causal-discipline S0' 0.902 (dIR +0.79 > +0.36 1SE; subperiod P1 0.752/P2 0.772/P3 3.080, all-positive 3/3) -> §2-4 adoption bar met, comparison_gate PASS 7/7. Promotion package pending this DSR/selection-bias gate."
    },
    {
      "script": "run_variant.py --variant variants/arm_s10_minchild30.yaml",
      "phase": "S10.2 degeneracy arm (2026-07-18, pre-registered in decision log S10.2 before execution)",
      "param_space": "lgbm_params.min_child_samples 60 -> 30 (single pre-registered parameter)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL: degenerate_rate 65.6% (21/32) vs baseline 53.1% - hypothesis refuted, degeneracy worsened. dIR -0.137 (noise band), sub dIR -0.429/-0.239/+0.339. Not adopted; production unchanged; HOLD stays on degenerate check."
    },
    {
      "script": "universe_scale_rebaselines_S9_S11_S13",
      "phase": "Adopted structural re-baselines (2026-07-16..07-26): 100-ticker unhedged-USD (S9), 150-ticker + PIT double-masking (S11.4), 200-ticker + SAN (S13.3). 1 trial each per redesign precedent.",
      "param_space": "universe/accounting coordinated change sets",
      "trials": 3,
      "result": "All three adopted as new S0 baselines (S9 1.599-era -> S9.1 1.570; S11.4 1.371; S13.3 1.5529)."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S11_5_arms",
      "phase": "S11.5 (2026-07-20): sector_active_risk_penalty lambda=5; val_window 252. Two single pre-registered arms.",
      "param_space": "2 single-flag arms",
      "trials": 2,
      "result": "Both E1 FAIL, not adopted. mu is z-scale so lambda*~26k would be needed (penalty inert at 5)."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S11_9_mh_blend",
      "phase": "S11.9 (2026-07-21): multi-horizon target blend arm.",
      "param_space": "multi_horizon_targets_enabled (single pre-registered blend)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1/E2 FAIL: term-structure collapse, turnover unchanged. Not adopted."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S11_10_lr",
      "phase": "S11.10 (2026-07-21): lgbm learning_rate 0.03 degeneracy arm.",
      "param_space": "lr=0.03 (single pre-registered value)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL: degenerate rate unchanged 56.25% (n_trees moved 8~9 only). Degeneracy candidate axis exhausted."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S12_arms",
      "phase": "S12 (2026-07-22): GPT-review follow-ups - stale-depth gate <=7 + 4 performance arms (objective hypothesis, mu scaling, refresh re-entry, PCA standardization).",
      "param_space": "5 single pre-registered configs",
      "trials": 5,
      "result": "stale-depth gate ADOPTED (first PRODUCTION flip of the S-series). 4 performance arms all rejected (hypothesis 40.6% disproven / scaling no-op / re-entry 0 / PCA worse all sub-periods)."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_4_surprise_opcf",
      "phase": "S13.4 (2026-07-26): EPS surprise / sales surprise / Fwd_OpCashflow level - three feature-admission arms on the 200 universe.",
      "param_space": "3 single-flag feature arms",
      "trials": 3,
      "result": "All E1 FAIL, dIR all negative, P2 consistently down. Not adopted."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_5_fwd_opcf_rev",
      "phase": "S13.5 (2026-07-26): Fwd_OpCashflow revision windows 63/126/252.",
      "param_space": "3 single-flag feature arms",
      "trials": 3,
      "result": "All E1 FAIL -> Fwd_OpCashflow axis exhausted."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_6_absent_nan",
      "phase": "S13.6 (2026-07-27): honest-NaN for absent fundamentals (banks) instead of median fill.",
      "param_space": "absent_fundamental_nan_enabled (single flag)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL dIR -0.388. Effect follows the MASK not the sector (fin +0.017 vs TSM -0.185) - median fill vindicated post-hoc."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_8_single_eval_metric",
      "phase": "S13.8 (2026-07-27): rank_eval_at [5,10]->[10] after root-causing degeneracy to best_iteration=min(argmax ndcg@5, argmax ndcg@10) (14/14 empirical).",
      "param_space": "rank_eval_at=[10] (single pre-registered change)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E2 confirmed (degenerate 18/32->11/32, trees 42.4->81.0) but E1 non-action dIR -0.0829. Not adopted; ndcg@5 discovered to act as implicit capacity regularizer."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_9_earnings_calendar",
      "phase": "S13.9 (2026-07-27): admit the 8 existing earnings-calendar conditioning features (model previously saw timing only via PEAD overlay).",
      "param_space": "earnings_calendar_feature_enabled (single 8-feature block)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL dIR -0.1932 despite IC +92% (0.0162->0.0311) and both counter-evidence checks passing (first in 19 arms). Damage localized: 21d prediction persistence 0.850->0.615."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_10_peer_earnings",
      "phase": "S13.10 (2026-07-27): relational peer-earnings cascade (3 features, first non-single-stock block).",
      "param_space": "peer_earnings_cascade_feature_enabled (single 3-feature block)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL dIR -0.0752, IC flat; peer_earn_lead_lag #1 split (6.88%) with 54% between-ticker variance = name-identity leak (design defect, not axis refutation). Spawned the >30% between-ticker pre-check rule."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_11_eta_2x2",
      "phase": "S13.11 (2026-07-27): 2x2 factorial eta {0.5,1.0} x features {S0, S13.9} to isolate execution-signal-speed interaction.",
      "param_space": "partial_rebalance_eta=1.00 on both feature sets (2 cells)",
      "trials": 2,
      "result": "Interaction +0.2418 (direction supported; iter17 rollback vindicated) but only ~11% of S13.9 loss recovered; eta recovery paid entirely in TE (IR +0.02). No cell beats S0. Not adopted."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_13_interaction_block",
      "phase": "S13.13 (2026-07-27): 5-feature nonlinear block - 4 products of core-parent CS z-scores + mom_consistency_252. Pre-checked structurally (persistence/btv/redundancy), IC untouched. NOTE: an initial 4-feature launch was killed UNOBSERVED before the user widened the block (not a trial).",
      "param_space": "interaction_features_enabled (single 5-feature block)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL dIR -0.0809 BUT first arm ever to improve book spec capture (+0.11%/yr) and degeneracy (0.500->0.375); entire loss is carry gap -0.42%/yr. Established carry-loss ~ 3%/yr per unit book divergence."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_14_ix_winner_protect",
      "phase": "S13.14 (2026-07-28): combined arm - interaction block + winner-trim hinge penalty lambda=1.0 on trailing-252d top-quintile (carrier diagnosis: PLTR/NVDA/TSLA composition, not factor exposures).",
      "param_space": "interaction_features_enabled + winner_trim_protection_enabled (pre-registered combination, lambda/quantile fixed)",
      "trials": 1,
      "result": "E1 FAIL dIR -0.1157. Hinge could not move the book (divergence 0.129->0.128): mega-winner underweight is a FORMATION problem (positions never built), not liquidation - meanwhile rotation freeze erased the spec gain (3.41->3.21). Interaction axis closed."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_15_nonlinear_confirmation",
      "phase": "S13.15 (2026-07-28): nonlinear-confirmation feature block. One accidental 5-feature result was observed before a wiring/order defect was detected; the formal rerun contained all 6 preregistered features.",
      "param_space": "observed accidental 5-feature implementation state + formal nonlinear_confirmation_features_enabled 6-feature arm",
      "trials": 2,
      "result": "Accidental 5-feature IR was observed but is invalid for adoption and counted conservatively. Formal 6-feature E1 FAIL: dIR -0.2726; P1/P2/P3 all worse. OFF."
    },
    {
      "script": "exp_S13_16_residual_nonlinear_sleeve",
      "phase": "S13.16 (2026-07-28): fixed 10% ex-ante variance-reserved explicit OOF nonlinear residual sleeve with A/B/C attribution.",
      "param_space": "A existing production (not recounted); B fixed sqrt(0.90) reserve-only diagnostic; C fixed sqrt(0.90) base + sqrt(0.10) covariance-orthogonal residual sleeve; no performance sweep",
      "trials": 2,
      "result": "REJECT. B-A dIR +0.0291 (reserve/de-risking helped), C-B dIR -0.0454 and C-A dIR -0.0163. P1 improved but P2/P3 worsened; residual score IC -0.0030. Structural risk-allocation gate also failed: residual-direction MVO infeasible on 63/84 active rebalances, so median realised residual variance share was 1.60% rather than 10%. Default remains OFF; no sign flip or post-hoc budget/model retune."
    }
  ],
  "n_trials_total": 451,
  "notes": [
    "396 is a conservative lower bound. Actual N is likely higher once",
    "ad-hoc config.py tweaks over the research period are counted.",
    "If in doubt, pass a larger --n_trials to run_selection_bias.py.",
    "The DSR penalty grows as sqrt(2*ln N), so going from 1 to 396 multiplies",
    "the haircut by sqrt(2*ln(396)) ~ 3.45, not by 396 itself.",
    "2026-07-06: +4 S7 AI-logic arms (A1 mu_vol_scaling, A2 confidence_spread_recal,",
    "A3 adaptive_ema, A4 seed_ensemble), all evaluated and OFF-default (no production flip).",
    "N 403 -> 407. A4's seed 43-46 harvests are non-selection diagnostic inputs, NOT counted",
    "as trials (they feed the single A4 ensemble config).",
    "2026-07-07: +1 S8 arm (news_trend sentiment feature), evaluated and OFF-default (no flip).",
    "N 407 -> 408.",
    "2026-07-10: causal-discipline work +4 distinct configs: iter15 causal S0' re-cert",
    "(both fixes, new baseline), decomposition arm A (causal_val_only), arm B (exec_lag_only),",
    "and challenger codex_causal_rank_65 (rank_xendcg, IR 1.695, promotion candidate). S0' counted",
    "as a distinct config (IR changed 1.481->0.902, not a byte-identical parity recheck).",
    "N 408 -> 412.",
    "2026-07-18: +1 S10.2 degeneracy arm (min_child_samples 30), pre-registered, E1 FAIL,",
    "not adopted (no flip). N 412 -> 413. S10.1 sector-limit recalibration is a report-only",
    "diagnostic threshold change (no weight/metric impact) and is NOT counted as a trial.",
    "2026-07-28: backfilled +26 configs covering S11.5..S13.14 (inventory had stopped at S10.2).",
    "N 413 -> 439. NOT counted: S11.8/S13.12 (measurement-only diagnoses on existing artifacts),",
    "S13.7 (pre-check disqualified the arm before any backtest), the aborted 4-feature S13.13",
    "launch (killed unobserved before amendment), and byte-identical parity/vintage rechecks.",
    "2026-07-28: +2 observed S13.15 implementation states and +2 S13.16 A/B/C new return series;",
    "A production was reused and not recounted. N 439 -> 443. S13.16 remained OFF after both",
    "economic and intended-risk-allocation gates failed.",
    "2026-07-29: +4 new return series - S13.18 (index-EPS 4-feature bcast arm, E1 FAIL/gain 0),",
    "S13.21 (2-feature subset arm, E1 FAIL/gain 0), S13.22a/b (carry TE-cap conditioning on",
    "fac_eps_g63 and g63+tech composite, both E1 FAIL; A -0.174, B +0.111 with E2 direction FAIL).",
    "Preflights S13.17/19/19a/20/20a reused existing artifacts (no new return series); the 19a/20a",
    "4-way spread sweeps are recorded as exploratory selection events in the decision log. N 443 -> 447.",
    "S13.23 country-mapped index revision feature arm (+1, E1 FAIL not adopted); the S0 recert on the 07-29 revision-vintage is a re-baseline, not a trial. N 447 -> 448.",
    "S13.25 fwd-sales-slope feature block + month-end rebalancing arms (A/B/C, +3) vs the 07-31 slope-vintage S0 recert (IR 1.3070, re-baseline not a trial): A (4 slope features) dIR +0.266 with all three sub-periods positive and block gain share 6.09pct (first material feature consumption on this program); B (month-end rebal) dIR -0.101; C (combined) dIR -0.001 (negative interaction, month-end schedule erases the feature gain). All three E1 FAIL (< +0.36), not adopted, defaults stay OFF. N 448 -> 451."
  ]
}
